5BSD import status
==================

Upstream:  Abseil LTS 20250127.1, https://github.com/abseil/abseil-cpp
Archive:   https://github.com/abseil/abseil-cpp/releases/download/20250127.1/abseil-cpp-20250127.1.tar.gz
SHA256:    b396401fd29e2e679cace77867481d388c807671dc2acc602a0259eeb79b7811
           (equal to the devel/abseil port's distinfo)
License:   LICENSE (Apache-2.0; upstream has no NOTICE file).
           absl/time/internal/cctz/src/tzfile.h is in the public domain.

Trimmed to what base builds (tools/build/protobuf/trim.py): the sources of
upstream's single-library build (CMake/AbseilDll.cmake, the "abseil_dll"
target) and the headers they and the imported protobuf need.  Not
imported: absl/flags, tests, benchmarks, test helpers and build files.

Local changes (tools/build/protobuf/patches):
  abseil-a4950fba-is_trivially_relocatable.patch	upstream commit
	a4950fba, as the devel/abseil port: clang 21 deprecates
	__is_trivially_relocatable.
  abseil-powerpc-timebase-frequency.patch	the devel/abseil port's
	FreeBSD/powerpc timebase sysctl fix.
  abseil-options-5bsd.patch	absl/base/options.h fixed for installed
	headers (std::any, optional, string_view, variant; absl ordering) and
	the inline namespace lts_20250127_5bsd.

Built by lib/libabsl as one private library, libprivateabsl.so.2501.
Installed licence: /usr/share/licenses/abseil-cpp.
